	<link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">

	    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="ft-16383859514621_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">** Trans-Union is reviewing the accumulated over-recovery of gas reflected in its Lost and Unaccounted For Regulatory Liability as recorded in Account 254. The ongoing review includes determining the root-cause of the over-recovery in order to evaluate the proper future disposition of the accumulated Lost and Unaccounted For from Account 254.</link:footnote>
